 earned in th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T08:38:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686360","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5167320-1846018067928733","game_id":"steam-5167320","kind":"announcement","title":"New Quest UI added to \"Contracts\" Mode!","summary":"Hey everyone!Thanks to popular demand from our community, we have added a brand-new Quest UI to the new \"Contracts\" mode! You can now easily track all your active objectives and assignments while in action.Thank you all for the great feedback – have fun blasting through your contracts!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T07:53:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928733","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5167320-1845383656385346","game_id":"steam-5167320","kind":"announcement","title":"Highscore Challenge: Get YOUR NAME featured in-game! 💣","summary":"Become immortalized in Fuse Rush! 💣💥Show off your demolition skills and claim your very own in-game tag!📅 Event Duration: October 2nd – October 9th🏆 How to Participate & Win:Download the free Fuse Rush Demo on Steam.Blast your way through all 13 levels and set high scores.If you hold #1 on at least 3 level leaderboards when the event ends, you win!🎁 The Reward: You’ll unlock your custom explosive banner in-game (e.g., \"Wait... did \\ just do that?!\") that triggers during huge detonations – featur","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T08:02:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656385346","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5167320-1845383656376776","game_id":"steam-5167320","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update – New Feedback Patch is Live!","summary":"Hey everyone!First off, a massive thank you to everyone who jumped in to play our demo! We're blown away by how many of you joined in and supported us.Based directly on your feedback, we've rolled out a few quick improvements:Remapped Restart Key: Restarting is now bound to 'N' (instead of R) to prevent any accidental level resets during gameplay.Tutorial NPC (Level 1): The NPC now explains your mission in much clearer detail.Level Tweaks: Visual adjustments for better clarity (e.g., updated bon","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T08:45:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656376776","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5167320-1844751498231948","game_id":"steam-5167320","kind":"announcement","title":"🚀 Fuse Rush Demo is LIVE + Official Trailer Released!","summary":"Hey everyone!The wait is over: The free Fuse Rush Demo is officially live on Steam right now! 💣💥To celebrate, we’ve also just released our brand-new trailer to give you a taste of the fast-paced action waiting for you.We want your feedback! Since the game is still actively in development, your input is super important to us. Jump into the demo, test the mechanics, and let us know what you think!💬 Feedback & Bug Reports: Drop your thoughts in the Steam Community Hub or join our Discord.⭐ Wishlist","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T16:10:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498231948","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:52:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analys